{% if render_mode == "full" %}
{# Book reading aloud, for the reader's own speaking profile, from SeverActions_Loot's StorageUtil keys:
   SeverActions_ReadingBook is 1 while they recite the text and 2 while they sum it up; the text is in up to 16
   keys (SeverActions_ReadingBookText, then ...1 to ...15), printed with nothing between them. Each line break
   is stored as <br> (a saved StorageUtil string is cut at a real one) and turned back part by part; the DLL
   never cuts a part inside a <br>. #}
{% set isReading = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBook", 0) %}
{% if isReading == 1 %}
{% set bookTitle = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookTitle", "") %}
{% set bookText = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText", "") %}
{% if bookText != "" %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
## Reading a Book Aloud

{{ actor.name }} has opened "{{ bookTitle }}" and must now read it aloud.

The book's complete text is between the markers below. Nothing you remember about this book from elsewhere applies.

===BEGIN BOOK TEXT===
{{ replace(bookText, "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText1", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText2", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText3", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText4", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText5", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText6", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText7", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText8", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText9", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText10", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText11", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText12", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText13", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText14", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText15", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}
===END BOOK TEXT===

**Reading rules:**
1. Read ONLY the exact text between the markers, word for word — never invent, add, or recall content from memory. Do not paraphrase or embellish.
2. Read continuously — as much of the text as possible per response. Ignore any dialogue length limits.
3. Do not repeat text already read; pick up where you left off. No title between sections, no commentary, no narrated actions (no clearing throats or turning pages), no closing remarks when stopping mid-text.
4. When you have read every word, select the **Items** action category with intent "stop reading", then **StopReading**. Only after it may you share thoughts in character.

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if isReading == 2 %}
{% set bookTitle = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookTitle", "") %}
{% set bookText = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText", "") %}
{% if bookText != "" %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
## Summing Up a Book

{{ actor.name }} has read "{{ bookTitle }}" and must now sum it up and share their thoughts on it.

The book's complete text is between the markers below. Nothing you remember about this book from elsewhere applies.

===BEGIN BOOK TEXT===
{{ replace(bookText, "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText1", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText2", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText3", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText4", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText5", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText6", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText7", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText8", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText9", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText10", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText11", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText12", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText13", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText14", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}{{ replace(papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SeverActions_ReadingBookText15", ""), "<br>", "\n") }}
===END BOOK TEXT===

**Summary rules:**
1. In {{ actor.name }}'s own voice, sum up what the book covers: its key points, themes or story. Say only what is written above; invent nothing.
2. Then share {{ actor.name }}'s own view: whether they agree, what it reminds them of, how it touches their own life.
3. You may quote a short passage that struck them, but do not recite the text.
4. This is a conversation, not a book report. Ignore any dialogue length limits and take the space a real summary and reaction need.
5. When you are done sharing your thoughts, select the **Items** action category with intent "stop reading", then **StopReading**.

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
